    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A DEMO IS AVAILABLE!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pardon My French Toast is a 3D platformer featuring a toast who can spread sweets on is face to get funny abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/8078096031b83f19f24137e3788a32c0.poster.avif?t=1750841933\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/8078096031b83f19f24137e3788a32c0.webm?t=1750841933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/8078096031b83f19f24137e3788a32c0.mp4?t=1750841933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Let's get sugary!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about a <strong>dozen abilities</strong>, each more amazing than the last!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spread honey on your face\u00a0</strong>to\u00a0stick to things and climb walls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use hardened chocolate</strong> to break stuff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Much more to discover!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/93360961480d7d226aa156176c717493.poster.avif?t=1750841933\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/93360961480d7d226aa156176c717493.webm?t=1750841933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/93360961480d7d226aa156176c717493.mp4?t=1750841933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A piece of cake?!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Jam Session's Cruise!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dozens of levels to find the big candies that fuel the boat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet some friendly toasts along the way and help them achieve their different goals.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ton of collectibles to find. Are you in?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/07610d351fa222857b62a8e58b55a7fd.poster.avif?t=1750841933\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/07610d351fa222857b62a8e58b55a7fd.webm?t=1750841933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/07610d351fa222857b62a8e58b55a7fd.mp4?t=1750841933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A DEMO IS AVAILABLE!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pardon My French Toast is a 3D platformer featuring a toast who can spread sweets on is face to get funny abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/8078096031b83f19f24137e3788a32c0.poster.avif?t=1750841933\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/8078096031b83f19f24137e3788a32c0.webm?t=1750841933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/8078096031b83f19f24137e3788a32c0.mp4?t=1750841933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Let's get sugary!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about a <strong>dozen abilities</strong>, each more amazing than the last!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spread honey on your face\u00a0</strong>to\u00a0stick to things and climb walls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use hardened chocolate</strong> to break stuff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Much more to discover!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/93360961480d7d226aa156176c717493.poster.avif?t=1750841933\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/93360961480d7d226aa156176c717493.webm?t=1750841933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/93360961480d7d226aa156176c717493.mp4?t=1750841933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A piece of cake?!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Jam Session's Cruise!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dozens of levels to find the big candies that fuel the boat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet some friendly toasts along the way and help them achieve their different goals.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ton of collectibles to find. Are you in?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/07610d351fa222857b62a8e58b55a7fd.poster.avif?t=1750841933\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/07610d351fa222857b62a8e58b55a7fd.webm?t=1750841933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/07610d351fa222857b62a8e58b55a7fd.mp4?t=1750841933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
